 "_about": "Variant A (printed courses/fins E=0.33 kN/cm2, pure weight). Smallest solid cast core per band in 20 mm steps passing: worst fibre -N/A+M/W <= 12 MPa (LONG, LIVEX, LIVEY) and <= 24 MPa (typhoon, EQ); buckling >= 5; max displacement <= 10.0 m/250 = 40 mm. Printed tube = core + 60 mm; bigger core weight via Karamba gravity, bigger tube weight via per-band gamma_eff. EQ point loads are fixed loads, not recomputed for the added mass. Found by stepping failing bands +20 mm, then trying -20 mm on each band. Canvases: polyframe2/stepped-<roof>-karamba-2m-formwork-A-sized-2026-11-23.gh"
